---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About" description="AIForgeWorx is a British Columbia consultancy for AI strategy, privacy and compliance, and development.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>About AIForgeWorx</h1>
      <p>A British Columbia consultancy for responsible, practical AI.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap two-col">
      <div class="prose">
        <!-- Replace this copy with your own story. -->
        <p>
          AIForgeWorx helps organizations move from AI interest to AI that works: chosen for the
          right reasons, built properly and governed so it stays trustworthy.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most AI projects don’t stall on the technology. They stall on unclear goals, privacy
          and security reviews, or the question of who is accountable once the solution is live.
          We treat those questions as part of the work, not a hurdle after it.
        </p>
        <h2>How we work</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We start with the problem, not the technology.</li>
          <li>We involve your privacy and security teams from the first workshop.</li>
          <li>We build in your environment, so your data stays under your control.</li>
          <li>We document everything, so your team can run the solution after we leave.</li>
          <li>We’d rather recommend a smaller, safer first project than overpromise.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <aside class="aside-panel">
        <h2>At a glance</h2>
        <p><strong>Based in</strong><br />{site.location}</p>
        <p><strong>Services</strong><br />AI Strategy, AI Privacy &amp; Compliance, AI Development</p>
        <p><strong>Platforms</strong><br />Microsoft Copilot Studio, Microsoft Foundry</p>
        <p><strong>Who we work with</strong><br />Public- and private-sector organizations</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
